      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is hereby established a Hispanic Criminal Justice Task Force, which shall gather and analyze data on the problems experienced by Hispanic persons in their dealings with criminal justice agencies, and recommend changes to improve services to Spanish-speaking persons who become involved in the criminal justice system.",
